  "solution": {
    "text": "In pyroxenes, there is a total of 3 oxygen atoms per silicon atom, so the simplest repeating unit is <math> <mrow>  <msup>   <mrow>    <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\">     <mrow>      <msub>       <mrow>        <mtext>SiO</mtext></mrow>       <mtext>3</mtext>      </msub>      </mrow>    </mfenced></mrow>   <mrow>    <mtext>2</mtext><mo>&#x2212;</mo></mrow>  </msup>  </mrow></math> or <math> <mrow>  <msubsup>   <mrow>    <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\">     <mrow>      <msub>       <mrow>        <mtext>SiO</mtext></mrow>       <mtext>3</mtext>      </msub>      </mrow>    </mfenced></mrow>   <mtext>n</mtext>   <mrow>    <mtext>2n</mtext><mo>&#x2212;</mo></mrow>  </msubsup>  </mrow></math>",
